{"id":57914,"date":"2026-08-08T15:17:03","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T14:17:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57914"},"modified":"2026-09-03T00:54:52","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T23:54:52","slug":"maratona-de-munique","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-munique\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Munique 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Munique 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Munique 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente <em>MARATHON M\u00dcNCHEN by Brooks<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na cosmopolita capital da Baviera, na <strong>Alemanha<\/strong>. Afirmando-se como uma das mais prestigiadas e c\u00e9nicas maratonas europeias de outono, o evento re\u00fane milhares de corredores internacionais para vivenciar a energia contagiante das ruas b\u00e1varas e a monumentalidade do parque ol\u00edmpico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no <strong>Olympiapark<\/strong> e uma chegada inesquec\u00edvel sobre o tartan do hist\u00f3rico <strong>Olympiastadion<\/strong> (palco dos Jogos Ol\u00edmpicos de 1972), o programa integra a <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h00<\/strong>, a <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, a <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>12h30<\/strong> e a Estafeta por equipas. O tra\u00e7ado plano e r\u00e1pido passa por postais ilustrados como o Englischer Garten, o Siegestor, a Odeonsplatz e a Marienplatz.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 